13
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,400
NIA: Forty-six twenty.

14
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:42,500
MARCUS: How?

15
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,500
NIA: I have my ways.

16
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:47,800
MARCUS: Receipts?

17
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,100
NIA: Already with our accountant.

18
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,200
